WEBVTT

00:00:00.570 --> 00:00:02.560
Oh, by the way, Koyuki...

00:00:01.810 --> 00:00:03.810
<b><i>Field Day</i></b>

00:00:02.560 --> 00:00:05.210
Did you turn in your
post-graduation plans survey?

00:00:05.920 --> 00:00:07.020
Not yet.

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.290
As a first-year, you said you 
wanted to go to college, right?

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.390
You not sure what to do now?

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:15.490
No, I still want to go to college... It's just...

00:00:15.490 --> 00:00:19.650
Well, my parents want me to go to the best 
school so I can work for the best company.

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.280
You know, the usual stuff.

00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:22.460
Your parents?

00:00:22.460 --> 00:00:25.330
What about you?
Nothing you want to do?

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.420
What I want?

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:30.950
I want to live in peace, away from any 
dark gods and privacy-violating mind readers.

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.460
It's not funny!

00:00:33.870 --> 00:00:36.880
What does a dark god of destruction even do?

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:40.050
If you, his teacher, can't set him straight,
 at least explain that to me!

00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:42.950
Whenever Hanadori says 
that name, disaster will—

00:00:42.950 --> 00:00:44.780
It's already a freaking disaster!

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:46.940
There, there.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.360
It's just what Hanadori wants to do.

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.500
What about you?

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.000
If you're still thinking about it, 
that means there must be something, right?

00:00:54.800 --> 00:00:58.950
There... might be something... sorta, kinda...

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:03.250
But it seems like it would be pretty tough...

00:01:16.260 --> 00:01:24.310
<b>A Destructive God Sits Next to Me</b>

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:41.220
<b><i>Delusion 3</i></b>

00:02:39.090 --> 00:02:41.430
Hanadori-kun, the paint...

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.200
You okay?

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.390
Oh, no! Our poster!

00:02:45.390 --> 00:02:46.480
Damnation!

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.380
Dark forces are working against me!

00:02:48.380 --> 00:02:50.340
They're trying to break my seal!

00:02:50.340 --> 00:02:52.290
What terrible strength!

00:02:52.290 --> 00:02:54.730
Just apologize, Hanadori.

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.020
So it's time to release the 
power of my left hand, is it?

00:02:58.020 --> 00:02:59.560
Very well...

00:02:59.920 --> 00:03:01.820
You're shaking, Hanadori.

00:03:02.000 --> 00:03:03.680
Was that glove expensive?

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.280
Better go wash it off.

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:07.620
Sensei, we don't have enough paint.

00:03:07.930 --> 00:03:10.680
I guess we'll have to send
someone to buy more.

00:03:10.680 --> 00:03:12.200
But we don't have the budget left.

00:03:12.360 --> 00:03:13.720
What? Seriously?

00:03:13.720 --> 00:03:16.050
Please buy it for us, Sensei.

00:03:16.050 --> 00:03:17.170
What?

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:21.130
Sheesh... Just this once, all right?

00:03:17.940 --> 00:03:21.120
<i>Yeah, it seems pretty rough.</i>

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:26.350
<i>I have enough to worry about 
in my own life right now.</i>

00:03:26.350 --> 00:03:29.570
<i>I don't have time to worry about the future.</i>

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:31.640
<i>You can't wash out paint with soap!</i>

00:03:34.960 --> 00:03:37.100
<i>Oh, man... This is infuriating.</i>

00:03:37.100 --> 00:03:39.400
<i>I'm not getting involv—</i>

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:39.400
Senpai?

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:43.740
You're Miguel-senpai, 
the dark god of destruction, right?

00:03:43.740 --> 00:03:45.780
I'm a first-year. No...

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:50.380
You might recognize me as your rival 
from the deadly battles of yore.

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:51.760
I am Helius.

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:54.920
In this world, I go by Kimiya Hibiki.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.410
A pleasure to meet you.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.720
Hey! Just who are you?! 
How do you know about Mig—

00:04:01.720 --> 00:04:03.010
Wait, Senpai!

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.140
Listen to me!

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:15.130
Have I committed another sin?

00:04:15.580 --> 00:04:17.300
Hey, what are you guys doing?

00:04:17.300 --> 00:04:18.670
Playing dead?

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:22.820
<i>Huh? Where am I?</i>

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:25.770
<i>What happened to me?</i>

00:04:26.250 --> 00:04:27.280
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:04:27.280 --> 00:04:29.340
<i>The back of my head really hurts!</i>

00:04:29.750 --> 00:04:31.810
<i>I can't remember...</i>

00:04:31.810 --> 00:04:35.700
I'm honored to meet you again
in this life, Miguel-senpai.

00:04:36.110 --> 00:04:37.240
<i>That's right.</i>

00:04:37.240 --> 00:04:39.680
<i>I ran into yet another weirdo, and...</i>

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:41.840
Do you remember me?

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:46.800
I'm No. 02 of the four dark
gods of destruction, Helius!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:48.670
I knew it was you at first glance.

00:04:48.670 --> 00:04:51.020
You have the aura of a man
 bearing a great destiny!

00:04:51.020 --> 00:04:52.500
You're Miguel-senpai,

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:56.110
the man I haven't forgotten for a 
single day over these long millennia!

00:04:56.110 --> 00:04:56.730
<i>Liar!</i>

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.860
<i>You thought I was Miguel.</i>

00:04:58.860 --> 00:05:01.410
<i>I remember because it 
was just that insulting!</i>

00:05:01.410 --> 00:05:03.190
<i>What's this guy's deal?</i>

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:05.020
<i>The four dark gods of destruction?</i>

00:05:05.020 --> 00:05:07.540
<i>He's not one of Hanadori-kun's LARPer buddies?</i>

00:05:07.540 --> 00:05:10.030
Oh, you're up, Seri-kun?

00:05:10.030 --> 00:05:11.930
Oh, Gestöber-senpai!

00:05:11.930 --> 00:05:13.040
I apologize for earlier.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.780
<i>Gestöber-senpai?!</i>

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:16.790
<i>Stop it! I'm not one of you!</i>

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.860
This brings back so many memories, doesn't it?

00:05:19.860 --> 00:05:20.760
<i>Not for me.</i>

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:24.280
Miguel-senpai always had charisma,

00:05:21.280 --> 00:05:22.330
<i>Who </i>is<i> this guy?</i>

00:05:22.330 --> 00:05:24.410
<i>And what's he dressed as? A cockroach?</i>

00:05:24.280 --> 00:05:26.960
but his dark aura is even stronger now.

00:05:24.410 --> 00:05:27.020
<i>He's got some weird replica 
weapon, too! What's his deal?</i>

00:05:27.020 --> 00:05:28.380
<i>Are you guys in the same weird club?</i>

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:30.220
<i>The "dark gods of destruction" group?</i>

00:05:30.370 --> 00:05:32.160
Seri-kun, I'll introduce you.

00:05:32.160 --> 00:05:33.930
Helius, a.k.a. Hibiki-kun,

00:05:33.930 --> 00:05:37.440
is a former comrade of Hanadori's 
who heard the rumors about him.

00:05:37.620 --> 00:05:39.760
He lost his power when he 
was reincarnated this time,

00:05:39.770 --> 00:05:41.410
so now he wants to serve Miguel again

00:05:41.410 --> 00:05:44.120
and lead this world to an even better end!

00:05:44.120 --> 00:05:45.950
<i>He's a global menace, then!</i>

00:05:47.860 --> 00:05:52.080
Miguel-senpai, the enemy is 
getting stronger by the day.

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:55.670
It's time for dark god of destruction 
No. 01 to use his power!

00:05:56.360 --> 00:05:59.880
<i>Wait, this is the first time Hanadori-kun's
had someone he can really talk to.</i>

00:06:00.130 --> 00:06:01.840
<i>It's a miracle, Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:03.540
<i>He can be your friend!</i>

00:06:03.540 --> 00:06:04.590
<i>I'll be cheering you on!</i>

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:06.530
<i>I'm not sure what that specifically entails,</i>

00:06:06.530 --> 00:06:08.050
<i>but I'm cheering for you!</i>

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:09.990
<i>So please leave me alone!</i>

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:12.140
Please, Miguel-senpai.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:13.860
<i>I'm begging you, too!</i>

00:06:14.230 --> 00:06:15.400
I'm sorry.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:16.930
<i>He refused!</i>

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:17.590
<i>Why?!</i>

00:06:17.590 --> 00:06:18.980
<i>What's wrong with you, Hanadori-kun?!</i>

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:21.360
<i>You may never get another chance like this!</i>

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:25.460
Gestöber, this weirdo won't leave me alone.

00:06:25.460 --> 00:06:28.000
<i>You mean like the way 
you won't leave me alone?</i>

00:06:28.370 --> 00:06:29.980
<i>Why are you so shy all of a sudden?</i>

00:06:29.980 --> 00:06:32.280
<i>He's a dark god of destruction! Your favorite!</i>

00:06:32.280 --> 00:06:33.830
<i>Now go and say hello!</i>

00:06:34.340 --> 00:06:35.790
No...

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:37.130
Miguel-senpai...

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:40.170
Gestöber-senpai,

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:45.750
<b>Rumble</b>

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:45.750
<b>Rumble</b>

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:45.750
<b>Rumble</b>

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:45.750
<b>Rumble</b>

00:06:40.170 --> 00:06:41.920
why are you getting in our way?

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:43.870
Are you my enemy?

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:45.760
<i>This is beyond a false accusation!</i>

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.050
<i>You're mistaken.</i>

00:06:47.050 --> 00:06:49.220
<i>I'm just a random villager!</i>

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.460
Why?

00:06:50.460 --> 00:06:53.430
Why does everyone get in my way?

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:56.720
Why doesn't anyone understand me?!

00:06:56.720 --> 00:06:57.760
<i>He's scary!</i>

00:06:58.290 --> 00:06:59.640
Sensei?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.580
Sorry to bother you.

00:07:05.670 --> 00:07:07.060
What are you doing?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:09.500
Nothing, really...

00:07:09.500 --> 00:07:12.500
Just meditating, Tsukimiya-senpai.

00:07:13.880 --> 00:07:16.090
Oh, it's the school secretary!

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:21.630
So many people came
into the room, Hibiki-kun!

00:07:21.630 --> 00:07:22.520
<i>Give him a break.</i>

00:07:22.800 --> 00:07:23.960
Huh?

00:07:23.960 --> 00:07:25.900
Where did the trio go?

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.760
No idea. They disappeared.

00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.920
But this'll go faster now, so we're better off.

00:07:30.730 --> 00:07:33.370
I'm like a crow or a black cat...

00:07:33.370 --> 00:07:35.680
An ill omen for those around me.

00:07:35.680 --> 00:07:38.490
Are we talking about Kimiya Hibiki-kun here?

00:07:38.490 --> 00:07:39.800
Not Helius?

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:40.760
Yes...

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:42.440
<i>I want to go home.</i>

00:07:42.440 --> 00:07:44.580
<i>But my head hurts and I don't want to move.</i>

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.900
<b>Ache</b>

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.900
<b>Ache</b>

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:47.900
<b>Ache</b>

00:07:44.580 --> 00:07:47.910
I bring disaster to those
around me for some reason.

00:07:48.120 --> 00:07:52.030
I get pooped and peed on by animals
as much as the average toilet,

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:55.120
and sudden rain clouds follow me around,

00:07:55.120 --> 00:07:57.620
and I live on the only block 
that Santa doesn't visit!

00:07:57.620 --> 00:07:59.380
Santa doesn't stop here.

00:07:59.380 --> 00:08:01.540
<i>I guess that's his family's policy?</i>

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:05.580
I'm not a kid detective, yet I'm always 
running into terrible crimes.

00:08:05.580 --> 00:08:07.000
So they call me the grim reaper,

00:08:07.000 --> 00:08:09.450
and everyone avoids me.

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.540
<i>Yeah, I want to avoid you, too.</i>

00:08:11.540 --> 00:08:12.220
<i>Sorry.</i>

00:08:12.450 --> 00:08:14.800
I'm worried about the upcoming field day, too.

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:18.060
Any team I'm on always loses.

00:08:18.060 --> 00:08:19.780
I'm scared of what people will think.

00:08:19.780 --> 00:08:21.520
I don't want to get on someone's bad side

00:08:21.640 --> 00:08:24.400
and end up surrounded by 
men in black suits again...

00:08:24.400 --> 00:08:25.730
<i>What happened to you?</i>

00:08:25.940 --> 00:08:28.220
Why am I the only one this happens to?

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:30.200
No... No!

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:31.720
I'm just different from the rest!

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.830
I've got a special talent! That's all!

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:35.240
<i>You got over that fast, huh?</i>

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:38.550
It was bad enough before,

00:08:38.550 --> 00:08:41.660
but once I assumed this identity,
I was treated even more like a weirdo.

00:08:41.660 --> 00:08:42.620
<i>No kidding.</i>

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:46.960
Then I heard that the dark god of destruction, 
Miguel, was in the grade above me,

00:08:47.290 --> 00:08:49.120
and I decided I wanted to be like him.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:52.500
What would it be like, I asked myself, 
if I could live without fear

00:08:52.500 --> 00:08:54.140
of what others thought?

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.500
<i>Are you making fun of him?</i>

00:08:56.420 --> 00:08:57.060
So...

00:08:58.550 --> 00:09:00.410
M-Miguel-senpa—

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:01.900
Does what you want

00:09:01.900 --> 00:09:05.540
mean so little that you're willing to 
give it up because you're worried

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.970
about what other people 
will think or say about you?

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:11.290
If it is, then it's better that you quit.

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:12.940
But if you're willing to suffer

00:09:12.940 --> 00:09:15.730
and be laughed at for it, tell me now!

00:09:15.730 --> 00:09:17.530
What is it you want?

00:09:22.870 --> 00:09:24.670
You're Grim Reaper Helius, aren't you?

00:09:24.670 --> 00:09:26.130
<i>You're calling him that, too?!</i>

00:09:30.390 --> 00:09:33.070
If there's something you want 
to do, you should do it.

00:09:33.070 --> 00:09:37.070
It's important to think that
there's a talent only you have.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:38.820
<i>What "talent" does a grim reaper have?</i>

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.970
People might make fun of you for 
caring so much about what you do,

00:09:43.250 --> 00:09:46.320
but they're just people who don't
do anything themselves.

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.020
You shouldn't let it bother you.

00:09:49.020 --> 00:09:50.980
Tsukimiya-senpai...

00:09:52.370 --> 00:09:58.740
Yup... so just... believe...
in your special talent...

00:09:59.880 --> 00:10:02.570
<i>Tsukimiya-kun's making fun of 
him more than anyone else!</i>

00:10:02.570 --> 00:10:04.850
Miguel-senpai, Tsukimiya-senpai,

00:10:04.850 --> 00:10:06.780
I'm going to live as Helius the rest of my life!

00:10:06.780 --> 00:10:07.460
<i>Huh?</i>

00:10:07.460 --> 00:10:08.770
<i>This seems like a happy ending,</i>

00:10:08.770 --> 00:10:11.300
<i>but they're talking about a fictional
character he made up, right?</i>

00:10:12.370 --> 00:10:14.590
I'm finally seeing what's going on here.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.640
The grim reaper was pretending to 
be a dark god of destruction, huh?

00:10:17.640 --> 00:10:23.110
The only dark god of destruction anyone
needs is the one sealed by Sturmhut, Miguel!

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.620
There sure as heck aren't four of us!

00:10:25.620 --> 00:10:27.140
Yes, you're very cool!

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:28.330
Thanks.

00:10:28.950 --> 00:10:30.570
<i>Oh, I get it.</i>

00:10:30.570 --> 00:10:36.120
<i>Hanadori-kun just didn't like this stuff about
four gods that wasn't part of his own fantasy.</i>

00:10:36.110 --> 00:10:39.070
<b><i>Nurse's Office</i></b>

00:10:36.250 --> 00:10:37.890
<i>I don't give a crap!</i>

00:10:39.370 --> 00:10:41.420
<i>But, weirdly,</i>

00:10:41.420 --> 00:10:44.540
<i>it felt a little like Hanadori-kun 
was lecturing me.</i>

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.500
<b>Future Plans Survey</b>

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.500
Year: 2\h\h\h\h\h\hClass: 3\h\h\h\h\hName: Koyuki Seri

00:10:44.530 --> 00:10:47.500
First Choice

00:10:44.930 --> 00:10:46.770
<i>It was really frustrating.</i>

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:49.660
<i>What about me?</i>

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.710
<i>Does it mean so little to me?</i>

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:54.780
That's one done!

00:10:56.980 --> 00:10:58.220
Hanadori-kun.

00:10:58.950 --> 00:10:59.630
Here.

00:10:59.760 --> 00:11:00.880
Paint remover.

00:11:00.880 --> 00:11:02.920
I got it from the janitor's office.

00:11:02.920 --> 00:11:04.980
It might bleach your glove a bit, though.

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:08.860
G-Gestöber!

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:10.880
If you're gonna cause trouble
for everyone by goofing off,

00:11:10.880 --> 00:11:12.440
you should at least apologize!

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:13.960
Apologize first!

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:16.290
Say, "I'm sorry for spilling paint!"

00:11:16.290 --> 00:11:18.890
I'll apologize for slacking off 
instead of working, too.

00:11:19.410 --> 00:11:22.720
Oh, are your decorations done, Senpai?

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:24.500
My class is coming along just—

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:27.660
<i>Wait...</i>

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.010
<i>You can't be serious!</i>

00:11:30.640 --> 00:11:31.760
<i>Nice catch!</i>

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:36.420
<i>That's fresh paint, fool!</i>

00:11:38.190 --> 00:11:39.770
<i>I'll never forget</i>

00:11:39.770 --> 00:11:42.840
<i>how my classmates looked like they 
were looking at a pile of garbage...</i>

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:47.910
<i>or that the grim reaper and god of 
destruction are just walking jinxes!</i>

00:11:50.020 --> 00:11:52.690
<i>I'm never getting involved with them again!</i>

00:11:52.690 --> 00:11:59.550
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:11:56.080 --> 00:11:59.030
Hey, do I need to go buy more paint?

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.940
Must be tough being a teacher.

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:03.740
Sure is.

00:12:06.720 --> 00:12:08.080
But, well...

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:12.000
<b>Future Plans Survey</b>

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:12.000
Year: 2\h\h\h\h\h\hClass: 3\h\h\h\h\hName: Koyuki Seri

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:12.000
First Choice\h\h\h\h\hWhere's the best place to go to be a teacher?

00:12:08.780 --> 00:12:10.830
It's not all bad.

00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:19.210
<b>Go, 
Red Team!</b>

00:12:13.900 --> 00:12:16.760
Tomorrow is finally field day!

00:12:16.760 --> 00:12:18.680
Red team, let's win this!

00:12:18.680 --> 00:12:19.500
Yay.

00:12:19.500 --> 00:12:21.920
<i>The time has come, Gestöber!</i>

00:12:20.040 --> 00:12:21.280
What's wrong, guys?

00:12:21.280 --> 00:12:24.200
You don't sound excited. Say, "Yeah!"

00:12:22.080 --> 00:12:25.320
<i>I don't care about beating
 the blue or white teams...</i>

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:27.540
No, we're just not as excited as you.

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:28.860
<i>I want to defeat this guy:
Hanadori Kabuto!</i>

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.850
What?

00:12:31.940 --> 00:12:35.060
<i>I've racked up nothing but 
losses across the board.</i>

00:12:40.500 --> 00:12:43.200
<i>I swore I'd never call out his antics,</i>

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:47.280
<i>but I still end up doing it every single time.</i>

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:56.190
<i>It's humiliating!</i>

00:12:56.190 --> 00:12:59.180
What's wrong, Koyuki? Did you 
eat something weird for lunch?

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:02.440
<i>I won't react to anything 
Hanadori-kun does anymore!</i>

00:13:03.280 --> 00:13:05.810
<i>I won't say a damn word!</i>

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.020
<i>Then, on field day...</i>

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:20.490
Go! Go!

00:13:20.490 --> 00:13:22.720
Scharlachrot Ritterorden!

00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:25.700
Go, go! Scharlachrot Ritterorden!

00:13:25.700 --> 00:13:28.660
Go, go! Scharlachrot Ritterorden!

00:13:26.240 --> 00:13:27.370
<i>That's so hard to say.</i>

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.660
<i>Just say "red team"!</i>

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:32.850
Wow, the red team is doing great.

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:34.300
Thanks to you, Miguel-senpai,

00:13:34.300 --> 00:13:36.730
the red team can still win 
even with me on it.

00:13:36.730 --> 00:13:38.060
We're not winning, though.

00:13:38.060 --> 00:13:39.130
Of course.

00:13:39.130 --> 00:13:41.360
I'm personally providing encouragement.

00:13:41.360 --> 00:13:42.760
We're not winning, though!

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:44.090
<i>Tsukimiya-kun...</i>

00:13:44.090 --> 00:13:45.440
I'm so happy.

00:13:45.440 --> 00:13:47.350
Working together with everyone

00:13:47.350 --> 00:13:50.550
has taught me how much fun field day can be!

00:13:50.550 --> 00:13:53.390
Go for it, red team! Go for it!

00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:00.430
<i>You should've expected that.</i>

00:14:01.460 --> 00:14:04.010
Everyone treats me like an outcast.

00:14:04.010 --> 00:14:07.540
If this is the destiny the 
grim reaper is born to bear,

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:09.660
I shall accept it.

00:14:09.660 --> 00:14:12.760
It really hurts, though, Miguel-senpai!

00:14:12.760 --> 00:14:15.620
Why do I have to be normal for
people to want to hang out with me?

00:14:15.620 --> 00:14:16.500
Helius!

00:14:16.500 --> 00:14:19.070
<i>Because they get hurt otherwise—
in more ways than one.</i>

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:21.230
Hey, Hanadori.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:23.920
That's my jacket.

00:14:23.920 --> 00:14:25.760
Why are you wearing it?

00:14:26.630 --> 00:14:27.840
Gori-Gorio!

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:30.320
Who are you calling Gori-Gorio?!

00:14:30.320 --> 00:14:33.300
That explains why this jacket is gorilla-sized.

00:14:33.300 --> 00:14:34.660
Take it off, punk!

00:14:34.660 --> 00:14:36.980
Let go, Iron Primate!

00:14:35.080 --> 00:14:36.980
Take it off! Take it off!

00:14:36.980 --> 00:14:39.340
You don't have the right to wear this jacket,

00:14:39.340 --> 00:14:41.980
the Robe of the Hell-Class Criminal!

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:42.800
<i>You need the right to wear that?</i>

00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.080
He took my clothes!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.320
Miguel-senpai...

00:14:47.320 --> 00:14:49.210
<i>So they're the same even on field day?</i>

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:51.200
<i>I'm amazed they never get bored.</i>

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:52.290
Neither do you.

00:14:52.290 --> 00:14:55.690
You keep whining, but you just
can't leave them alone.

00:14:55.690 --> 00:14:57.660
It's a talent, in a way.

00:14:57.660 --> 00:15:02.720
<i>It's nothing compared to your
talent for reading minds.</i>

00:15:03.370 --> 00:15:05.220
Could you tell I was making fun of you?

00:15:05.220 --> 00:15:06.000
<i>I'll kill you.</i>

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:07.130
Now, calm down.

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:10.990
I have good news for the boy who
can't stop thinking about Hanadori.

00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:14.450
<b>Mitoya High 
53rd Annual Field Day 
Program</b>

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.470
<i>Don't say it like that.</i>

00:15:12.470 --> 00:15:15.420
Today, you get to see Hanadori-kun,
the boy who can't talk to girls,

00:15:15.420 --> 00:15:18.290
and Hibiki-kun, the boy who 
shows off but is scared of people,

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:21.250
<b>Shiver</b>

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:29.320
<b>Shiver</b>

00:15:17.600 --> 00:15:29.320
<b>Shiver</b>

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.870
folk dance with girls!

00:15:20.870 --> 00:15:22.040
<i>You're really nasty.</i>

00:15:22.040 --> 00:15:23.730
Will Hanadori be okay?

00:15:23.730 --> 00:15:25.580
Can he hold her hand?

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:29.010
Oh, I know you're not much better, Seri-kun.

00:15:29.010 --> 00:15:29.960
<i>I swear I'll kill you.</i>

00:15:32.500 --> 00:15:35.620
I'm fine, I'm fine, I'm fine, 
I'm fine, I'm fine, I'm fine...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:36.900
It's fine, Helius.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:39.570
Just act like you normally do!

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:41.690
Okay. I'm fine. I'm fine.

00:15:41.690 --> 00:15:43.390
<i>He doesn't look fine...</i>

00:15:42.250 --> 00:15:44.390
May I please have this dance?

00:15:44.390 --> 00:15:45.320
Sure, let's dance!

00:15:45.320 --> 00:15:46.420
Are you a first-year?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.520
Y-Yes...

00:15:47.520 --> 00:15:48.730
You're cute!

00:15:48.730 --> 00:15:52.140
I'm two years older than you, 
so I'll show you how it's done, okay?

00:15:52.300 --> 00:15:54.060
<i>Act like I normally do...</i>

00:15:54.400 --> 00:15:57.470
Be careful, miss.

00:15:57.940 --> 00:16:01.540
I'm Helius the grim reaper.
I bring bad luck—

00:16:04.510 --> 00:16:05.260
What?

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:06.780
What did he say he was?

00:16:06.780 --> 00:16:08.560
He caught bird poop...

00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:10.540
Maybe he's the grim poop-catcher?

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.210
I knew I couldn't do it!

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:18.390
<i>Hibiki-kun, stop waving that scythe around.</i>

00:16:18.580 --> 00:16:21.010
<i>Your luck is as bad as you said,</i>

00:16:21.010 --> 00:16:25.580
<i>but it feels less like you run into trouble 
and more like you cause it.</i>

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.800
<i>Wait, someone else is holding things up...</i>

00:16:27.800 --> 00:16:29.190
<i>And of course it's you!</i>

00:16:30.380 --> 00:16:32.500
Um, can you hurry it up?

00:16:33.290 --> 00:16:36.240
How dare you speak that way 
to Miguel, the dark god?

00:16:37.260 --> 00:16:38.720
What did you say?

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.020
You were mumbling too much for me to hear.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:41.020
<i>What are you doing, Hanadori-kun?</i>

00:16:41.020 --> 00:16:44.190
<i>Now's the time to pretend to be Miguel.</i>

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:48.740
<i>Wait, why do I have to worry about him?</i>

00:16:48.740 --> 00:16:50.170
<i>He's not my friend.</i>

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:53.850
<i>And some humiliation might cool his jets.</i>

00:16:53.850 --> 00:16:54.980
You there, girl!

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:59.960
Don't underestimate Miguel,
the dark god of destruction!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:01.660
<b>Shloop</b>

00:17:05.560 --> 00:17:07.250
<i>S-Sweat?</i>

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:09.800
<i>Was all that slick stuff sweat?</i>

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:11.820
Crap.

00:17:11.820 --> 00:17:13.920
I got dark god of destruction juice on me.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:17.160
My hand will be darkly destroyed!

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:21.770
<i>H-Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:17:21.770 --> 00:17:23.850
<i>I-I-It's okay, Hanadori-kun!</i>

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:25.550
<i>You were just too nervous!</i>

00:17:25.550 --> 00:17:27.740
<i>I'm sure everyone will understand someday...</i>

00:17:27.740 --> 00:17:29.740
<i>Tsukimiya, you ass!</i>

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:31.340
<i>I'm sorry, Hanadori-kun.</i>

00:17:31.340 --> 00:17:34.980
<i>I said you could use some humiliation,
 but that was too much.</i>

00:17:34.980 --> 00:17:36.200
Miguel-senpai.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.340
Oh, Helius.

00:17:38.340 --> 00:17:39.960
Are you okay?

00:17:39.960 --> 00:17:41.580
Y-Yes.

00:17:41.580 --> 00:17:45.130
But when I held out my hand,
bird poop fell on it...

00:17:45.760 --> 00:17:47.090
Helius!

00:17:47.090 --> 00:17:47.660
But...

00:17:47.660 --> 00:17:51.700
The girl I was paired up with wiped
my hand off with her handkerchief!

00:17:49.100 --> 00:17:52.210
Are you okay? Here, give me your hand.

00:17:51.700 --> 00:17:55.630
You can stay true to yourself and some 
people will still accept you after all.

00:17:55.900 --> 00:17:57.840
You were right, Miguel-senpai!

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:02.510
<i>Hibiki-kun, you just pushed
 a man on the edge of a cliff...</i>

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.970
Don't sweat it, Hanadori.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.550
Just because someone you 
thought was below you on

00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:08.710
the totem pole surpassed 
you to find happiness

00:18:08.710 --> 00:18:10.770
is no reason to get all depressed!

00:18:10.770 --> 00:18:12.520
<i>How deep are you gonna dig into him?!</i>

00:18:12.520 --> 00:18:13.690
<i>You'll put a hole in him!</i>

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:14.860
<i>Oh, no.</i>

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.120
<i>I can see the light in his eyes fading.</i>

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.040
<i>He'll probably be afraid of women
 for the rest of his life...</i>

00:18:20.810 --> 00:18:21.740
<i>I can see it...</i>

00:18:21.740 --> 00:18:25.350
<i>I can see him at a psychiatrist
a decade or two from now.</i>

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:29.270
Someone out there will accept me! I know it!

00:18:29.270 --> 00:18:31.750
<i>If that happened, I'd cry, too.</i>

00:18:34.590 --> 00:18:36.450
Could it be?!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:40.040
Hanadori-kun's awkwardness around
women has turned into raw fear

00:18:40.040 --> 00:18:44.140
and combined with his rejection into 
a powerful mix of love and hatred!

00:18:44.140 --> 00:18:45.510
<i>Brutal...</i>

00:18:46.200 --> 00:18:46.900
Hanadori!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:47.920
Miguel-senpai!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.120
Let's go after him!

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:54.650
<b>Glee</b>

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:54.650
<b>Glee</b>

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:54.650
<b>Glee</b>

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:54.650
<b>Glee</b>

00:18:49.120 --> 00:18:51.810
Something terrible will happen
if Miguel goes out of control!

00:18:51.810 --> 00:18:52.380
Right!

00:18:52.380 --> 00:18:53.550
<i>Don't get so excited!</i>

00:18:53.550 --> 00:18:54.650
<i>Just let him go!</i>

00:18:54.800 --> 00:18:56.610
<i>He's just going to cry in the bathroom.</i>

00:18:56.610 --> 00:19:00.060
<i>It's time for a final performance
 from each team.</i>

00:19:00.060 --> 00:19:02.580
Here's Gori-Gorio-kun,
the leader of the red team!

00:19:02.580 --> 00:19:04.150
Who are you calling Gori-Gorio?!

00:19:04.480 --> 00:19:05.750
Don't laugh.

00:19:07.200 --> 00:19:08.490
Wait, Miguel!

00:19:08.490 --> 00:19:10.040
No, Sturmhut!

00:19:10.180 --> 00:19:13.340
You've always tried to suppress Miguel!

00:19:13.340 --> 00:19:17.050
But the stronger your desire to suppress him,
 the stronger his resistance!

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:18.200
Right?!

00:19:18.940 --> 00:19:20.240
Miguel-senpai!

00:19:22.850 --> 00:19:26.060
Unleash Miguel's emotion!

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:29.480
A cry from your soul!

00:19:30.630 --> 00:19:33.660
I am Miguel, the dark god of destruction!

00:19:34.440 --> 00:19:39.860
I shall share this hellish pain
 with all of humanity!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:46.700
<i>Don't cheer.</i>

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:52.670
What was that about?

00:19:54.880 --> 00:19:58.580
Your murderous desires are still too strong...

00:19:59.110 --> 00:20:03.050
The dark god of destruction is 
starting to take over this school.

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.440
There's no time for excitement!

00:20:05.440 --> 00:20:08.760
<i>Gestöber, come back to us!</i>

00:20:08.760 --> 00:20:11.010
<i>A new battle is about to begin!</i>

00:20:11.010 --> 00:20:12.190
<i>Steel yourself!</i>

00:20:12.190 --> 00:20:14.320
<i>Yay! You watching, Seri-kun?</i>

00:20:14.320 --> 00:20:17.930
<i>Gestöber-senpai, get well soon!</i>

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:20.360
<i>And here's your lunch for today!</i>

00:20:20.360 --> 00:20:23.280
<b>FRIENDS</b>

00:20:20.680 --> 00:20:23.900
<i>I had your mom make it for you.</i>

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:26.060
<i>Friends forever!</i>

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:27.290
<i>Isn't that nice, Hanadori?</i>

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.870
<i>I did the camerawork!</i>

00:20:29.870 --> 00:20:31.000
<i>Can you see me?</i>

00:20:31.770 --> 00:20:34.010
And that's how field day went.

00:20:34.010 --> 00:20:35.400
Was it fun to watch?

00:20:40.760 --> 00:20:45.020
Why am I yelling at a screen when
I was lucky enough to get sick today?!

00:20:45.220 --> 00:20:46.500
What kind of ending was that?!

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:48.060
I feel stupid for worrying—

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.720
Gestöber, I didn't know you cared so much...

00:20:51.260 --> 00:20:54.770
Okay, old man. Back to bed with you.

00:20:54.770 --> 00:20:57.780
I <i>wanted</i> to stay in bed,
and you guys barged in here!

00:20:59.440 --> 00:21:02.570
<i>Even when home sick, I, Koyuki Seri,</i>

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:01.340
But you said we could come before.

00:20:59.860 --> 00:21:09.080
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:00.750 --> 00:21:09.080
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:09.080
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:03.680
What's wrong, Gestöber-senpai?

00:21:02.570 --> 00:21:05.150
<i>can't win the battle to keep from yelling.</i>

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:09.080
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:03.680 --> 00:21:06.440
You did eat dinner last night, 
didn't you, old man?

00:21:04.800 --> 00:21:09.080
RIP
Koyuki

00:21:05.150 --> 00:21:07.940
I'll get you when I'm feeling bett—

00:21:06.890 --> 00:21:09.080
RIP
Koyuki

00:22:41.080 --> 00:22:44.580
<i>Tsukimiya-kun always talks
about married women,</i>

00:22:44.580 --> 00:22:46.940
<i>but I wonder if he really
does anything with them.</i>

00:22:47.480 --> 00:22:52.080
<i>He's crazy. What if they were 
married to some really scary guy?</i>

00:22:52.080 --> 00:22:55.800
Come now, Seri-kun! Do you 
really think of me that way?

00:22:55.800 --> 00:22:58.020
It's just a thing boys my age do. You know...

00:22:58.020 --> 00:22:59.620
"I don't care about girls my age.

00:22:59.620 --> 00:23:02.620
A hot guy like me needs 
older, married women!"

00:23:02.620 --> 00:23:06.200
It's just one of those things 
guys say to sound cool.

00:23:06.560 --> 00:23:08.290
<i>So he's admitting it?</i>

00:23:08.440 --> 00:23:09.980
You follow?

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:12.760
<i>Don't take my food.</i>

00:23:13.950 --> 00:23:19.040
<b>Seri's Mom</b>

00:23:13.960 --> 00:23:16.940
<i>I was really proud of the lunch I made today.</i>

00:23:16.940 --> 00:23:19.040
<i>Did Seri like it?</i>

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:22.000
I got a message from your mom! 
She's so cute! I'm out!

00:23:22.000 --> 00:23:25.010
Hold it right there, damn it!

00:23:25.340 --> 00:23:27.000
Help me, Gestöber!

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:28.260
Wh-What's wrong?

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:31.410
The character designer and 
chief animation director are gone!

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:33.070
We're still running with that?

00:23:33.070 --> 00:23:36.600
I'll just have to summon
the servants of darkness!

00:23:35.640 --> 00:23:38.720
Oh, fine! I'll help you, okay?
